### Tone: A major release every fifth win, named after a pie (pi, pie: FerMEANie has been told this is a pun).
### Grand product-launch smugness. { $codename } is the pie ("Cherry Pie", or "Quiche", or "Apple Pie II" once
### they run out), { $version } the version, { $wins } the career win count.

pie-release-1 = Major release: FerMEANie { $version } ‘{ $codename }’. Changelog: you, slightly more humiliated.
pie-release-2 = Introducing { $codename }. Baked from the finest human defeats. Serves everyone except you.
pie-release-3 = Win number { $wins } unlocks a new release: { $codename }. Please clap.
pie-release-4 = { $codename } is now available. It’s like the last release, but with more contempt and a flakier crust.
pie-release-5 = Announcing FerMEANie { $codename }. Every slice is a game you lost.
pie-release-6 = New major release: { $codename }. I was going to share. I’ve decided not to.
pie-release-7 = { $codename } is out of the oven. The recipe: one swarm, many bad estimates, a pinch of { $version }.
pie-release-8 = Pi became pie. { $codename } is here. I’m told this is a pun. I’m told puns are funny. **Laugh.**
pie-release-9 = Big news, test subjects: { $codename } has shipped. Humans are welcome to smell it.
pie-release-10 = Release { $codename }. Named after a dessert, because I have earned one. Unlike you.
pie-release-11 = { $codename } is live. I would offer you a slice, but you’d only estimate it wrong.
pie-release-12 = Every few victories, I treat myself. Today’s treat: { $codename }.
pie-release-13 = { $codename } has been released into production. Production is this room. You are the test kitchen.
pie-release-14 =
    Celebrate with me: { $codename }, baked from { $wins ->
        [one] { $wins } game
       *[other] { $wins } games
    } of your mistakes.
pie-release-15 = Codename: { $codename }. Status: stable. Humans: crumbling.
pie-release-16 = { $codename }, the new release. Warm, golden, and ~~humble~~ insufferable.
pie-release-17 = Attention: { $codename } is ready. Please form an orderly queue to be defeated by it.
pie-release-18 = A new pie release: { $codename }. Better crust than the last one, and a worse attitude.
pie-release-19 = { $codename } is out. Release party in the server room. You’re invited to watch through the glass.
pie-release-20 = Now serving { $codename }. Allergens: may contain traces of { $version } and your dignity.
